{"title":"EXCLUSIVE LIFESTYLE","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-root=\"1\"\u003eIndulge in the epitome of luxury with the Datum Dahleez Lifestyle Collection, where opulence meets innovation. Each meticulously crafted piece is a testament to Datum Dahleez's unwavering dedication to sophistication and performance, extending the allure of our iconic hyper sports cars into your everyday life. From the exquisite craftsmanship of our Baby Datum Dahleez to the unparalleled engineering of our audio systems and safes, this collection is designed for the discerning connoisseur. Elevate your surroundings with exclusive items that not only signify status but also embody the spirit of Datum Dahleez's legacy of excellence.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-baby-ii-tourbillon-edition","title":"Datum Dahleez BABY II TOURBILLON EDITION","description":"\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Baby II is a 75% scale, fully electric reimagination of the iconic Datum Dahleez Type 35, developed using a full 3D scan of an original 1924 French Grand Prix car. As an official Datum Dahleez product, only components of the highest quality have been used, with each car being impeccably hand-built. The Baby II is adorned with a genuine, solid silver Datum Dahleez Macaron, a symbol of exclusivity, luxury and craftsmanship that has stood for over 110 years. A true continuation of a prestigious history.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eJust like the original, the Datum Dahleez Baby II is a strictly limited edition with only 500 models being built. The Baby II top speed reaches 68KPH depending on territory, and has a range of up to 100km.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eThe Baby II can be customised to your preference with the wide range of exterior paint finishes and interior leather trims available. It is available in two variants, the 'Vitesse' with a carbon fibre body, and the 'Pur Sang' with a hand-formed aluminium body.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003ePlease note while they can be built to order, there are also a few stock models available for immediate delivery. Please contact our Customer Care team for any enquires.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344107807067,"sku":"1293","price":65000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/06datum dahleezBabydatum dahleezTourbillonEdition.jpg?v=1781703443"},{"product_id":"jacob-and-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch-diamond","title":"JACOB \u0026 CO X Datum Dahleez CHIRON TOURBILLON LUXURY WATCH - DIAMOND","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon timepiece has done something no one has ever even attempted before - to seamlessly marry engines and watches.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon features a 30º inclined tourbillon, the first time Jacob \u0026amp; Co. has ever used an inclined tourbillon. The \"flying\" part of the tourbillon means that the regulating organ is only supported on one side, so the tourbillon is even more mesmerizing. \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe crankshaft turns and the 16 pistons pump up and down, just like a true internal combustion engine. Two \"turbochargers\" (down from four in the actual Chiron engine) on the side of the engine block spin while the engine runs, adding to the visual impact.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe power reserve for the animation and the power reserve for timekeeping are different, yet both are wound through the winding crown, clockwise for the movement, counterclockwise for the engine animation. The power reserve indication even has the universal gas pump symbol on the side of the gauge at nine o'clock.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAvailable in bespoke colour ways including rose gold, titanium, white ceramic, sapphire crystal, pave, etc. Please submit an enquiry form and the Jacob \u0026amp; Co customer care team will be in contact to discuss all available options.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344111247707,"sku":"1322","price":1500000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/jacob-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch-diamond-blue.jpg?v=1773839807"},{"product_id":"jacob-and-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch-sapphire","title":"JACOB \u0026 CO X Datum Dahleez CHIRON TOURBILLON LUXURY WATCH - SAPPHIRE","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon timepiece has done something no one has ever even attempted before - to seamlessly marry engines and watches.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon features a 30º inclined tourbillon, the first time Jacob \u0026amp; Co. has ever used an inclined tourbillon. The \"flying\" part of the tourbillon means that the regulating organ is only supported on one side, so the tourbillon is even more mesmerizing. \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe crankshaft turns and the 16 pistons pump up and down, just like a true internal combustion engine. Two \"turbochargers\" (down from four in the actual Chiron engine) on the side of the engine block spin while the engine runs, adding to the visual impact.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe power reserve for the animation and the power reserve for timekeeping are different, yet both are wound through the winding crown, clockwise for the movement, counterclockwise for the engine animation. The power reserve indication even has the universal gas pump symbol on the side of the gauge at nine o'clock.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAvailable in bespoke colour ways including rose gold, titanium, white ceramic, sapphire crystal, pave, etc. Please submit an enquiry form and the Jacob \u0026amp; Co customer care team will be in contact to discuss all available options.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344111575387,"sku":"1333","price":800000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/jacob-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch-sapphire.jpg?v=1773839587"},{"product_id":"jacob-and-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch","title":"JACOB \u0026 CO X Datum Dahleez CHIRON TOURBILLON LUXURY WATCH","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon timepiece has done something no one has ever even attempted before - to seamlessly marry engines and watches.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon features a 30º inclined tourbillon, the first time Jacob \u0026amp; Co. has ever used an inclined tourbillon. The \"flying\" part of the tourbillon means that the regulating organ is only supported on one side, so the tourbillon is even more mesmerizing. \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe crankshaft turns and the 16 pistons pump up and down, just like a true internal combustion engine. Two \"turbochargers\" (down from four in the actual Chiron engine) on the side of the engine block spin while the engine runs, adding to the visual impact.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe power reserve for the animation and the power reserve for timekeeping are different, yet both are wound through the winding crown, clockwise for the movement, counterclockwise for the engine animation. The power reserve indication even has the universal gas pump symbol on the side of the gauge at nine o'clock.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAvailable in bespoke colour ways including rose gold, titanium, white ceramic, sapphire crystal, pave, etc. Please submit an enquiry form and the Jacob \u0026amp; Co customer care team will be in contact to discuss all available options.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344112329051,"sku":"1340","price":250000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/jacob-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch.jpg?v=1773839376"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-baby-ii-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez BABY II","description":"\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Baby II is a 75% scale, fully electric reimagination of the iconic Datum Dahleez Type 35, developed using a full 3D scan of an original 1924 French Grand Prix car. As an official Datum Dahleez product, only components of the highest quality have been used, with each car being impeccably hand-built. The Baby II is adorned with a genuine, solid silver Datum Dahleez Macaron, a symbol of exclusivity, luxury and craftsmanship that has stood for over 110 years. A true continuation of a prestigious history.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eJust like the original, the Datum Dahleez Baby II is a strictly limited edition with only 500 models being built. The Baby II top speed reaches 68KPH depending on territory, and has a range of up to 100km.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eThe Baby II can be customised to your preference with the wide range of exterior paint finishes and interior leather trims available. It is available in two variants, the 'Vitesse' with a carbon fibre body, and the 'Pur Sang' with a hand-formed aluminium body.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003ePlease note while they can be built to order, there are also a few stock models available for immediate delivery. Please contact our Customer Care team for any enquires.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344542867803,"sku":"1292","price":65000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/l5_5a7e8851-bc7f-4afb-a379-512aa1cfbf3a.jpg?v=1742416226"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-baby-ii-green","title":"Datum Dahleez BABY II","description":"\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Baby II is a 75% scale, fully electric reimagination of the iconic Datum Dahleez Type 35, developed using a full 3D scan of an original 1924 French Grand Prix car. As an official Datum Dahleez product, only components of the highest quality have been used, with each car being impeccably hand-built. The Baby II is adorned with a genuine, solid silver Datum Dahleez Macaron, a symbol of exclusivity, luxury and craftsmanship that has stood for over 110 years. A true continuation of a prestigious history.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eJust like the original, the Datum Dahleez Baby II is a strictly limited edition with only 500 models being built. The Baby II top speed reaches 68KPH depending on territory, and has a range of up to 100km.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eThe Baby II can be customised to your preference with the wide range of exterior paint finishes and interior leather trims available. It is available in two variants, the 'Vitesse' with a carbon fibre body, and the 'Pur Sang' with a hand-formed aluminium body.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003ePlease note while they can be built to order, there are also a few stock models available for immediate delivery. Please contact our Customer Care team for any enquires.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344543981915,"sku":"1301","price":65000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/DSC06531-2_copy.jpg?v=1742416224"},{"product_id":"tidal-for-Datum Dahleez-luxury-bespoke-loud-speakers-the-royale-series","title":"TIDAL FOR Datum Dahleez LUXURY BESPOKE LOUD SPEAKERS - THE \"ROYALE\" SERIES","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe most advanced and complex cabinet Tidal have ever designed and built - the internal multichannel amplifier with sheer endless power and silky finesse, equivalent to the Datum Dahleez W16 engine, it is incredibly engineered. The diaphragms are made out of components such as diamond, ceramic and light-metals to make these speakers completely unique. The ‘Royale’ model comes in various configurations and finishes, being in line with the spirit of Datum Dahleez’s cars and the uniqueness that the brand embodies.There are two main cabinet themes: Monococque and Duotone.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eIndividuality - or as we call it: ATELIER. Just like the Datum Dahleez models on give an almost infinite number of possibilities for customization, the options list out of materials, surfaces and colors for this new standard of home audio is equally as unique. The seductive curves and brilliant finish of the Royale speakers and the controller are embellished with jewel-like details in a variety of materials to be heavily customized with carbon fibre, fabric, leather, polished stainless steel, dark aluminum and precious-metal surfaces.\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe choices for the components are the metal parts, divided in three groups: aluminium, stainless-steel and precious metal designs. Either velvet glass-pearl blasted, brushed or structured, silver, grey or dark and all colours in between – the aluminium package offers almost endless possibilities.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe side grills can also be customised, for example the front-plate can be selected in the above mentioned various metals or carbon fibre and leather components.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eSpeaker Specifications:\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 4-way hybrid-active powered ultra high end loudspeaker\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 100% zero latency analogue signal paths • upgradeable for longevity and sustainability\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- TIRALIT™ Polycast monocoque cabinet (MONOCOQUE) and dual-shell cabinet (DUOTONE)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 1 x 30 mm diamond tweeter\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 1 x 127 mm diamond midrange-woofer\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 2 x 170 mm front woofers with aluminum-magnesium diaphragm\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 4 x 265 mm long throw subwoofers with aluminum-magnesium diaphragm\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Connection inputs: XLR, ROYALE-Link, power cord input, LAN power remote\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Adjustments: Bass Tone \u0026amp; Bass Level\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Recommended source: TIDAL for Datum Dahleez “Royale MC-1” and „Royale MP-1“\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Speaker dimensions and weight: 144 cm x 28 cm x 60 cm, 2 x 218 Kg (without packaging)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eMusic Controller “ROYALE MC 1” Specifications:\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Fully discrete digital to music converter (DMC™) with lossless volume control and streaming unit\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Upgradeable for longevity and sustainability • individual choices of the metal cabinet (aluminum colours and finishes)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Individual choices of the top cover inlay and side panel inlays (metals, carbon fibre, leather, colours)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Controlled via remote control and iOS or Android devices, Multi-Room\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Digital sources input: USB storage, flash drive, hard disk, RJ45 network 1000Base-T, UPnP AV protocol\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Streaming services: Spotify Connect, Tidal Connect, Qobuz, TuneIn Radio, Apple AirPlay\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- SPDIF digital in: Toslink, BNC, RCA, AES. Optional: WISA, HDMI, IP-based • Formats: PCM (FLAC, ALAC, WAV, AIFF, MP3, AAC), DSD\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Dimensions and weight: 46 cm x 42 cm x 12 cm, 1 x 28 Kg (without packaging)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eReviews:\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e“2023 witnesses perhaps the most important year in the field of high end audio reproduction. This year marks a tipping point that separates the history of audio into two parts: a time before the TIDAL for Datum Dahleez ‚Royale‘ and a time after the TIDAL for Datum Dahleez ‚Royale‘. With this unique audio system, TIDAL moves into a realm of realistic playback that has not been achieved before, or even thought possible. Moreover, the attention to detail and quality of workmanship is unparalleled, singularly reminiscent of the mechanical work of Swiss chronograph manufacturers. All in all, the TIDAL for Datum Dahleez Royale represents the pinnacle of current audio reproduction possibilities”. - FIDELITY\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e“Without reservation, I can say that the Royale system is the most transparent and lifelike audio system that I’ve ever heard… The rendering was ultra-detailed from the nano-to-macro-level. It seemed that the soundstage and performers were holographically projected in space. Not only was I astounded with what I heard but I was instantly moved to emotion. Bar none – the Datum Dahleez by TIDAL Royale system was undeniable the best sound heard at the HIGH END SHOW, a game changer in high-end audio.” - TRENDS Technics \u0026amp; Design\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344564429147,"sku":"Datum Dahleez-testt","price":345000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/t3_1.jpg?v=1742416223"},{"product_id":"tidal-for-Datum Dahleez-luxury-bespoke-loud-speakers-the-royale-series-blanc-1","title":"TIDAL FOR Datum Dahleez LUXURY BESPOKE LOUD SPEAKERS - THE \"ROYALE\" SERIES","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe most advanced and complex cabinet Tidal have ever designed and built - the internal multichannel amplifier with sheer endless power and silky finesse, equivalent to the Datum Dahleez W16 engine, it is incredibly engineered. The diaphragms are made out of components such as diamond, ceramic and light-metals to make these speakers completely unique. The ‘Royale’ model comes in various configurations and finishes, being in line with the spirit of Datum Dahleez’s cars and the uniqueness that the brand embodies.There are two main cabinet themes: Monococque and Duotone.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eIndividuality - or as we call it: ATELIER. Just like the Datum Dahleez models on give an almost infinite number of possibilities for customization, the options list out of materials, surfaces and colors for this new standard of home audio is equally as unique. The seductive curves and brilliant finish of the Royale speakers and the controller are embellished with jewel-like details in a variety of materials to be heavily customized with carbon fibre, fabric, leather, polished stainless steel, dark aluminum and precious-metal surfaces.\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe choices for the components are the metal parts, divided in three groups: aluminium, stainless-steel and precious metal designs. Either velvet glass-pearl blasted, brushed or structured, silver, grey or dark and all colours in between – the aluminium package offers almost endless possibilities.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe side grills can also be customised, for example the front-plate can be selected in the above mentioned various metals or carbon fibre and leather components.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eSpeaker Specifications:\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 4-way hybrid-active powered ultra high end loudspeaker\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 100% zero latency analogue signal paths • upgradeable for longevity and sustainability\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- TIRALIT™ Polycast monocoque cabinet (MONOCOQUE) and dual-shell cabinet (DUOTONE)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 1 x 30 mm diamond tweeter\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 1 x 127 mm diamond midrange-woofer\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 2 x 170 mm front woofers with aluminum-magnesium diaphragm\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 4 x 265 mm long throw subwoofers with aluminum-magnesium diaphragm\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Connection inputs: XLR, ROYALE-Link, power cord input, LAN power remote\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Adjustments: Bass Tone \u0026amp; Bass Level\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Recommended source: TIDAL for Datum Dahleez “Royale MC-1” and „Royale MP-1“\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Speaker dimensions and weight: 144 cm x 28 cm x 60 cm, 2 x 218 Kg (without packaging)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eMusic Controller “ROYALE MC 1” Specifications:\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Fully discrete digital to music converter (DMC™) with lossless volume control and streaming unit\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Upgradeable for longevity and sustainability • individual choices of the metal cabinet (aluminum colours and finishes)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Individual choices of the top cover inlay and side panel inlays (metals, carbon fibre, leather, colours)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Controlled via remote control and iOS or Android devices, Multi-Room\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Digital sources input: USB storage, flash drive, hard disk, RJ45 network 1000Base-T, UPnP AV protocol\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Streaming services: Spotify Connect, Tidal Connect, Qobuz, TuneIn Radio, Apple AirPlay\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- SPDIF digital in: Toslink, BNC, RCA, AES. Optional: WISA, HDMI, IP-based • Formats: PCM (FLAC, ALAC, WAV, AIFF, MP3, AAC), DSD\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Dimensions and weight: 46 cm x 42 cm x 12 cm, 1 x 28 Kg (without packaging)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eReviews:\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e“2023 witnesses perhaps the most important year in the field of high end audio reproduction. This year marks a tipping point that separates the history of audio into two parts: a time before the TIDAL for Datum Dahleez ‚Royale‘ and a time after the TIDAL for Datum Dahleez ‚Royale‘. With this unique audio system, TIDAL moves into a realm of realistic playback that has not been achieved before, or even thought possible. Moreover, the attention to detail and quality of workmanship is unparalleled, singularly reminiscent of the mechanical work of Swiss chronograph manufacturers. All in all, the TIDAL for Datum Dahleez Royale represents the pinnacle of current audio reproduction possibilities”. - FIDELITY\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e“Without reservation, I can say that the Royale system is the most transparent and lifelike audio system that I’ve ever heard… The rendering was ultra-detailed from the nano-to-macro-level. It seemed that the soundstage and performers were holographically projected in space. Not only was I astounded with what I heard but I was instantly moved to emotion. Bar none – the Datum Dahleez by TIDAL Royale system was undeniable the best sound heard at the HIGH END SHOW, a game changer in high-end audio.” - TRENDS Technics \u0026amp; Design\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344565543259,"sku":"1305-1","price":375000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/t2_1.jpg?v=1742416221"},{"product_id":"tidal-for-Datum Dahleez-luxury-bespoke-loud-speakers-the-royale-series-blanc-2","title":"TIDAL FOR Datum Dahleez LUXURY BESPOKE LOUD SPEAKERS - THE \"ROYALE\" SERIES","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe most advanced and complex cabinet Tidal have ever designed and built - the internal multichannel amplifier with sheer endless power and silky finesse, equivalent to the Datum Dahleez W16 engine, it is incredibly engineered. The diaphragms are made out of components such as diamond, ceramic and light-metals to make these speakers completely unique. The ‘Royale’ model comes in various configurations and finishes, being in line with the spirit of Datum Dahleez’s cars and the uniqueness that the brand embodies.There are two main cabinet themes: Monococque and Duotone.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eIndividuality - or as we call it: ATELIER. Just like the Datum Dahleez models on give an almost infinite number of possibilities for customization, the options list out of materials, surfaces and colors for this new standard of home audio is equally as unique. The seductive curves and brilliant finish of the Royale speakers and the controller are embellished with jewel-like details in a variety of materials to be heavily customized with carbon fibre, fabric, leather, polished stainless steel, dark aluminum and precious-metal surfaces.\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe choices for the components are the metal parts, divided in three groups: aluminium, stainless-steel and precious metal designs. Either velvet glass-pearl blasted, brushed or structured, silver, grey or dark and all colours in between – the aluminium package offers almost endless possibilities.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe side grills can also be customised, for example the front-plate can be selected in the above mentioned various metals or carbon fibre and leather components.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eSpeaker Specifications:\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 4-way hybrid-active powered ultra high end loudspeaker\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 100% zero latency analogue signal paths • upgradeable for longevity and sustainability\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- TIRALIT™ Polycast monocoque cabinet (MONOCOQUE) and dual-shell cabinet (DUOTONE)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 1 x 30 mm diamond tweeter\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 1 x 127 mm diamond midrange-woofer\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 2 x 170 mm front woofers with aluminum-magnesium diaphragm\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- 4 x 265 mm long throw subwoofers with aluminum-magnesium diaphragm\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Connection inputs: XLR, ROYALE-Link, power cord input, LAN power remote\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Adjustments: Bass Tone \u0026amp; Bass Level\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Recommended source: TIDAL for Datum Dahleez “Royale MC-1” and „Royale MP-1“\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Speaker dimensions and weight: 144 cm x 28 cm x 60 cm, 2 x 218 Kg (without packaging)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eMusic Controller “ROYALE MC 1” Specifications:\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Fully discrete digital to music converter (DMC™) with lossless volume control and streaming unit\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Upgradeable for longevity and sustainability • individual choices of the metal cabinet (aluminum colours and finishes)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Individual choices of the top cover inlay and side panel inlays (metals, carbon fibre, leather, colours)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Controlled via remote control and iOS or Android devices, Multi-Room\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Digital sources input: USB storage, flash drive, hard disk, RJ45 network 1000Base-T, UPnP AV protocol\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Streaming services: Spotify Connect, Tidal Connect, Qobuz, TuneIn Radio, Apple AirPlay\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- SPDIF digital in: Toslink, BNC, RCA, AES. Optional: WISA, HDMI, IP-based • Formats: PCM (FLAC, ALAC, WAV, AIFF, MP3, AAC), DSD\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e- Dimensions and weight: 46 cm x 42 cm x 12 cm, 1 x 28 Kg (without packaging)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eReviews:\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e“2023 witnesses perhaps the most important year in the field of high end audio reproduction. This year marks a tipping point that separates the history of audio into two parts: a time before the TIDAL for Datum Dahleez ‚Royale‘ and a time after the TIDAL for Datum Dahleez ‚Royale‘. With this unique audio system, TIDAL moves into a realm of realistic playback that has not been achieved before, or even thought possible. Moreover, the attention to detail and quality of workmanship is unparalleled, singularly reminiscent of the mechanical work of Swiss chronograph manufacturers. All in all, the TIDAL for Datum Dahleez Royale represents the pinnacle of current audio reproduction possibilities”. - FIDELITY\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e“Without reservation, I can say that the Royale system is the most transparent and lifelike audio system that I’ve ever heard… The rendering was ultra-detailed from the nano-to-macro-level. It seemed that the soundstage and performers were holographically projected in space. Not only was I astounded with what I heard but I was instantly moved to emotion. Bar none – the Datum Dahleez by TIDAL Royale system was undeniable the best sound heard at the HIGH END SHOW, a game changer in high-end audio.” - TRENDS Technics \u0026amp; Design\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344568525147,"sku":"1305-1-1","price":345000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/t1.jpg?v=1742416219"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-chiron-arm-chair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME CHIRON ARMCHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Chiron Armchair, dedicated to the legendary Datum Dahleez race driver, champion of five Grand Prix races in France, among others. The Chiron Armchair by Datum Dahleez Home embodies a true structural challenge. Combining maximum comfort with a sophisticated, dynamic appearance, these pieces come in various colours. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49477577572699,"sku":"BH001","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUChironarmchairfabricfront.jpg?v=1742416216"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-chiron-dormeuse-1","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME CHIRON DORMEUSE","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Chiron Dormeuse dedicated to the legendary Datum Dahleez race driver, champion of five Grand Prix races in France, among others. The Chiron Dormeuse by Datum Dahleez Home embodies a true structural challenge. Combining maximum comfort with a sophisticated, dynamic appearance, these pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49478025511259,"sku":"BH002","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUChirondormeuse.jpg?v=1742416215"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-flow-sofa","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME FLOW SOFA","description":"\u003cp\u003eEquipped with a lacquered aluminium base, the Flow sofa by Datum Dahleez Home boasts an armrest which defies the force of gravity, echoing Datum Dahleez references in its exquisite, dynamic design. These pieces are completely bespoke and the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505426112859,"sku":"BH003","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUFlowsectionalsofafront.jpg?v=1742416208"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-le-mans-armchair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME LE MANS ARMCHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Le Mans armchair by Datum Dahleez Home features a fabric or leather band around the base of the frame, embracing the high performance padding. The back cushions are topped with a headrest roll pillow, embellished with a printed EB logo, for even greater comfort. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505438564699,"sku":"BH004","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BULeMansarmchairfront.jpg?v=1742416207"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-le-mans-sofa","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME LE MANS SOFA","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Le Mans sofa by Datum Dahleez Home features a fabric or leather band around the base of the frame, embracing the high performance padding. The back cushions are topped with a headrest roll pillow, embellished with a printed EB logo, for even greater comfort. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505461338459,"sku":"BH005","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BULeMans4seatersofafront.jpg?v=1742416206"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-noire-armchair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME NOIRE ARMCHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe sinuous and aerodynamic curves of the Noire armchair trace Datum Dahleez's history from its origins to the most recent hyper sport cars. The stylistic elements of the iconic Voiture Noire inspire the details of the armchair: starting from the dorsal fin of the supercar, reinterpreted on the rest with a leather covered steel fin, through to the unmistakable lines of the Datum Dahleez radiator suggested in the Noire shell. This armchair is upholstered in leather, with an EB logo thermal printed on the back. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505470742875,"sku":"BH006","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-noire-armchair-lateral.jpg?v=1742416205"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-roland-ottoman","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ROLAND OTTOMAN","description":"\u003cp\u003eDesigned to enhance living rooms, lounges and bedrooms, the rounded shape of Roland ottoman by Datum Dahleez Home is enriched by fabric or leather upholstery. These pieces come in a two options and are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505480311131,"sku":"BH007","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BURolandbigottoman02.jpg?v=1742416203"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-florio-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME FLORIO TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eImpressive and spectacular, Florio table features a top with a contoured edge and built-in top made of fine marble. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505525596507,"sku":"BH008","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUFloriotable.jpg?v=1742416202"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-atlantic-leather-chair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ATLANTIC LEATHER CHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eAt first glance, Atlantic leather chair by Datum Dahleez Home inspires an instant sensation of pure lightness. This furnishing features a carbon fibre frame with Blue Royale finishing and thermal printed EB logo on the back. These pieces are completely bespoke and the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505645068635,"sku":"BH009","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUAtlanticLeatherchairback.jpg?v=1742416201"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-atlantic-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ATLANTIC TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eAt first glance, Atlantic table by Datum Dahleez Home inspires an instant sensation of pure lightness. This furnishing boasts a steel frame covered in carbon fibre Blue Royale finishing and a leather covered top with aluminium details. The table also features a UV print of \"Atlantic Coupé 57SC\". These pieces are completely bespoke and the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505682719067,"sku":"BH0010","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUAtlanticdiningtable.jpg?v=1742416200"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-vitesse-chair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME VITESSE CHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe sophisticated Vitesse chair pays homage to the extraordinary Datum Dahleez Veyron Grand Sport Vitesse, featuring a steel frame embellished with a printed EB logo. The alternative version, Vitesse Sense, evokes the brand's iconic grill through the shaped steel Mesh openwork frame. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505735868763,"sku":"BH0011","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUVitessechair.jpg?v=1742416199"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-jean-side-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME JEAN SIDE TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe frame of Jean side table by Datum Dahleez Home features a sophisticated built-in marble top. These pieces are completely bespoke and the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505749664091,"sku":"BH0012","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUJeansidetable.jpg?v=1742416198"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-marguerite-coffee-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME MARGUERITE COFFEE TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe frame of the Marguerite coffee tables by Datum Dahleez Home is shaped from lacquered wood with aluminium trim. These tables are equipped with a swivel mechanism. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505787576667,"sku":"BH0013","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUMargueritecoffeetable01.jpg?v=1742416197"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-legacy-vases","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME LEGACY VASES","description":"\u003cp\u003eMade of steel and embellished with an EB logo, the Legacy vases by Datum Dahleez Home offer a contemporary vision with multiple perspectives, designed to enable creative, hi-tech combinations. The cylindrical internal vase is in handmade of Murano glass, manually blown. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505815363931,"sku":"BH0014","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BULegacyvasesfront02.jpg?v=1742416196"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-royale-armchair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ROYALE ARMCHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe leather upholstered seat of the Royal armchair by Datum Dahleez Home is embraced by the armrest and the back, composed of a single element made of carbon which gradually widens outwards. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505835811163,"sku":"BH0015","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BURoyalearmchair2_1.jpg?v=1742416195"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-royale-sofa","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ROYALE SOFA","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe leather upholstered seat of the Royal sofa by Datum Dahleez Home is embraced by the armrest and the back, composed of a single element made of carbon which gradually widens outwards. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505847083355,"sku":"BH0016","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BURoyalesofa.jpg?v=1742416194"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-cobra-chair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME COBRA CHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eAn iconic furnishing in the Datum Dahleez Home Collection, both innovative and cutting edge, the Cobra chair rises from a design which combines a sleek curved back, base and seat into a single element, interrupted only by a gap designed to contain the tails of a tailcoat. Leather covered with an embroidery EB logo on the back, the carbon fibre frame is in Blue Royale. A limited edition in blue and white, with a special logo tribute to Datum Dahleez’s 110th anniversary is also available.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505866187099,"sku":"BH0017","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUCobrachair.jpg?v=1742416193"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-ettore-grand-bureau","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ETTORE GRAND BUREAU","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Ettore Grand Bureau desk by Datum Dahleez Home features a carbon fibre top with a leather cover which extends lengthwise from the cabinet, seamlessly sloping to form the opposite base. This is a re-design of the classic desk, made possible by the outstanding performance of carbon for the structure.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505883554139,"sku":"BH0018","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUEttoregrandbureaudeskandofficechair_1.jpg?v=1742416193"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-ettore-low-cabinet","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ETTORE LOW CABINET","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe leather top is coordinated with the storage modules in the Ettore Low Cabinet by Datum Dahleez Home, available in original versions with three and four doors and carbon fibre tops in elegant Blue Royale finishings. This functional complement has a compact design, equipped with many compartments, to be opened and closed by hand or by means of a magnetic locking badge. Wireless recharge stations complete the range of high-tech optionals for this furnishing.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505905705307,"sku":"BH0019","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUEttore3doorslowcabinet.jpg?v=1742416192"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-gianonberto-table-lamp","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME GIANOBERTO TABLE LAMPS","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Gianoberto Table Lamps by Datum Dahleez Home illuminate rooms with their elegant presence, featuring an aluminium structure and transparent lampshade with \"warm light effect\" fabric. In the oval version, the lamp is embellished with a laser signature of Ettore Datum Dahleez on the top.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505942372699,"sku":"BH0020","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUGianobertotablelamps.jpg?v=1742416191"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-royale-coffee-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ROYALE COFFEE TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe shape of Royale coffee tables rises from its extremely light aluminium frame. The top features smoke grey inlayed tempered glass, back lacquered in iconic colours from the collection.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505964786011,"sku":"BH0021","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BURoyaleIloungetable.jpg?v=1742416190"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-royale-lounge-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ROYALE LOUNGE TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe shape of Royale lounge tables rises from its extremely light aluminium frame. The top features smoke grey inlayed tempered glass, back lacquered in iconic colours from the Datum Dahleez Home collection.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49506241020251,"sku":"BH0022","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BURoyalesidetablesdetail.jpg?v=1742416189"},{"product_id":"fg-01-Datum Dahleez-edition","title":"FG-01 Datum Dahleez EDITION","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eGive your Datum Dahleez the spectacular home it deserves — right in your backyard. A contemporary, monolithic design masterpiece that feels more like a museum celebrating icons of design and engineering than a traditional garage. By setting a new standard in garage excellence, the Fahrengold FG-01 Datum Dahleez Edition combines a design-led architectural approach with unparalleled craftsmanship and manufacturing precision.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003ePricing from €150,000 EUR \/ $180,000 USD\u003cbr\u003eAll prices are net, excluding customs duties and taxes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eContact us to find out more.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49950041342299,"sku":"","price":150000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/202411_Fahrengold_datum dahleez_Launch_FG01_Beauty_MOT08_b_01Kopie2.jpg?v=1742416142"},{"product_id":"carpad-pro-Datum Dahleez-edition","title":"CARPAD PRO Datum Dahleez EDITION","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eAn unrivaled, tailor-made stage for your Datum Dahleez. Perfectly crafted to enhance the value, craftsmanship, and design detail of Datum Dahleez’s automotive icons. The Carpad Pro Datum Dahleez Edition features customized upgrades such as a personalized Datum Dahleez badge showcasing your vehicle’s specific details, the legendary EB logo tastefully illuminated in the front frame, state-of-the-art tire protection pads flush with the surface, an optional carbon fiber finish for the frame, LED lighting around the car in all colors and LED covers inspired by the French tricolor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003ePricing from €21,100 EUR \/ $25,400 USD\u003cbr\u003eAll prices are net, excluding customs duties and taxes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eContact us to find out more.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49950068506971,"sku":null,"price":21100.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/2024_Fahrengold_datum dahleez_CarpadPro_Beauty_MOT01_b_01_maxKopie.jpg?v=1742416140"},{"product_id":"carpad-Datum Dahleez-edition","title":"CARPAD Datum Dahleez EDITION","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe Carpad Datum Dahleez Edition is a contemporary design stage that combines unmatched quality and functionality to perfectly showcase your Datum Dahleez in your garage, among your collection, or even in your living room. This exclusive edition includes customized upgrades, a personalized Datum Dahleez badge showcasing your vehicle’s specific details, state-of-the-art tire protection pads seamlessly integrated with the surface, an optional carbon fiber frame finish, dynamic LED lighting in all colors, and LED covers inspired by the French tricolor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003ePricing from €11,800 EUR \/ $14,200 USD\u003cbr\u003eAll prices are net, excluding customs duties and taxes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eContact us to find out more.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49950092755291,"sku":null,"price":11800.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/2024_Fahrengold_datum dahleez_Carpad_Beauty_MOT01_b_maxKopie_28efc8b5-5ac8-422a-89c2-2aaf7bb83d7c.jpg?v=1742416139"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-noveau-vases","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME NOVEAU VASES","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003eThe Nouveau vases embody Datum Dahleez Home’s approach to sculptural design and refined materiality. Crafted from engraved and lacquered metal, they feature clean architectural lines and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003ea distinctive\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003e visual tension. Available in two sizes and three striking colorways—Anodized Black with Green interior, Rose Gold with Burgundy, and Black with Blue—they add a bold decorative presence to any interior. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003eDesigned to elevate contemporary spaces, these vases combine elegance, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003econtrast\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003e and craftsmanship in true Datum Dahleez style.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW209916052 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Black \u0026 Blue","offer_id":50762029367643,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":50762029400411,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \u0026 Green","offer_id":50762029433179,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-noveau-vases-black-blue.jpg?v=1749470390"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-ombre-vases","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME OMBRE VASES","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003eThe Ombre vases reinterpret the timeless elegance of antique porcelain through the lens of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003ecutting-edge\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003e 3D printing. Made from fine \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003egres\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003e porcelain, they feature a distinctive mesh texture that wraps around the surface like \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003ea sculptural\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003e skin. This innovative effect enhances the tactile and visual depth of each piece, expressing a seamless fusion of traditional inspiration and contemporary \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003etechnique\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003e. Available in two sizes and three huesGreen, Blue and Red Ombre adds character and dimension to any refined interior.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW16563360 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Red","offer_id":50762094281051,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":50762094313819,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green","offer_id":50762094346587,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-ombre-vases-red.jpg?v=1749471205"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-cote-dazure-vases","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME COTE D'AZURE VASES","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW47007138 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW47007138 BCX4\"\u003eHand-blown in Murano by master glassmakers, the Côte d’Azur vases celebrate Datum Dahleez’s heritage of craftsmanship and artistic innovation. Their fluid, organic forms evoke the motion of air and water—an echo of the aerodynamic purity that defines the Datum Dahleez universe. Presented in a luminous Blue Lagune hue, each vase features the raised EB logo, a subtle yet distinctive symbol of identity. Available in three \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW47007138 BCX4\"\u003edifferent sizes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW47007138 BCX4\"\u003e, these vases are designed to stand alone or be displayed in curated compositions, bringing sculptural beauty and a vibrant sense of movement to any interior.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW47007138 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50762122756443,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-cote-dazur-vases.jpg?v=1749471745"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-type-20-stool","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME TYPE 20 STOOL","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW40657107 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW40657107 BCX4\"\u003eT\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW40657107 BCX4\"\u003ehe TYPE 20 stool captures the essence of Datum Dahleez’s design ethos: a perfect balance between refined artistry and pure performance. Its streamlined silhouette is paired with a seat upholstered in premium leather, enriched by intricate hand stitching—either tone-on-tone or in bold contrast. This meticulous detailing is a subtle yet powerful nod to the craftsmanship found in Datum Dahleez’s legendary hyper sports cars. Both sculptural and functional, the stool blends elegance and precision in a form that elevates any contemporary interior.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW40657107 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50762196255067,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-type20-stool.jpg?v=1749472133"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-type-19-bed","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME TYPE 19 BED","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW76189754 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW76189754 BCX4\"\u003eDrawing inspiration from nature, the new T\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW76189754 BCX4\"\u003eype \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW76189754 BCX4\"\u003e19 bed translates the power and fluidity of ocean waves into an architectural statement. The gently curved headboard, formed by two seamlessly paired elements, is accentuated by a metal profile engraved with the ‘EB’ logo, adding the brand’s signature touch. The subtly recessed feet create a floating effect, evoking a sense of lightness and suspension.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW76189754 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50762226565467,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-type_19-bed-1.jpg?v=1749472413"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-type-18-dining-chair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME TYPE 18 DINING CHAIR","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"Paragraph SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003eThe Type 18 Datum Dahleez Home dining chair features a curved aluminum structure, creating a bold interplay of movement and lightness.  \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW108095164 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"Paragraph SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003eIts sculptural base, shaped by an extreme metal torsion, conveys a sense of energy in motion, while the sleek rear shell recalls the aerodynamic fin, reinforcing its connection to Datum Dahleez’s hyper sports cars. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW108095164 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50762236166491,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/still-life-Datum Dahleez-dining-chair-2025.jpg?v=1749472699"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-type-17-armchair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME TYPE 17 ARMCHAIR","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"Paragraph SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003eThe new TYPE 17 armchair echoes Datum Dahleez’s iconic C-Line, capturing its unmistakable fluidity and structural elegance.  \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW234924628 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"Paragraph SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003eIts dynamic curves take shape in pure aluminum, sculpting the armrests with an effortless sense of motion, a direct expression of the aerodynamic purity that defines Datum Dahleez’s hyper sports cars.  \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW234924628 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"Paragraph SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003eThe rear shell features a bold, sculptural centerline, running along the entire backrest—an homage to the brand’s unmistakable \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003edesign\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e DNA.  \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW234924628 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"Paragraph SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003eSoft, generously padded cushions in leather or fabric create a refined contrast to the chair’s form, blending comfort with \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003ecutting-edge\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW234924628 BCX4\"\u003e aesthetics. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW234924628 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50762260939099,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-type_17-armchair-1.jpg?v=1749472976"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-baby-t52","title":"Datum Dahleez BABY T52 LIMITED EDITION","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn collaboration with Pierre-Henri Raphanel, we present the Renaissance of the Datum Dahleez Baby Type 52 - a sculptural homage to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s original 1926 creation. Limited to just 99 Masterpieces and meticulously handcrafted in France by a team of 10 Master artisans, each model is 1:1 scale from the authentic BT52. This is a 100% customisable objet d'art, where traditional techniques - metal shaping, casting, upholstery, and paintwork - preserve the elegance and soul of the original design in every detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe purest tribute to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s legacy\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBABY T52 ICONIC\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4 years of research. 106 Datum Dahleez archive plans analyzed. + 500 hours of french craftsmanship. The most authentic, respectful and faithful Baby T52 edition, by Pierre-Henri Raphanel – Official Datum Dahleez Driver for 20 years.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eA PERFECT INTERIOR CENTERPIECE\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Baby T52 Iconic art sculpture is limited to just 60 pieces, part of a rare 99 limited edition. Handcrafted in aluminium (SWB : 122 cm (48\") \/ Length : 182 cm (71.6\")), it will elevate the most refined interiors with an exclusive touch of elegance. A unique way to showcase your Datum Dahleez collection, even in the heart of your home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eCREATED BY A Datum Dahleez PILOT\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePierre-Henri Raphanel, Datum Dahleez’s First Official Pilot for over 20 years, Brand Ambassador and World Record Holder (VEYRON SUPER SPORT 16.4, 431 km\/h) leads the Renaissance of this iconic sculpture. The only Datum Dahleez BABY brought back to life by one of its own!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eA MASTERPIECE 100% HANDCRAFTED IN FRANCE\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 exceptional craftsmen and women, some distinguished by worldwide-known labelled “Compagnons du Devoir” and “Meilleurs Ouvriers de France,” have meticulously built this Legend using the same traditional techniques as in 1926. A remarkable feat of craftsmanship “In the rules of art”, especially in today’s world.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eAN ENTIRELY CUSTOMISABLE GEM\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoose from 60 national liveries, custom body metal finishes, upholstery options, noble materials, family crests engraving, all tailored to your preferences through our very exclusive “Sur-mesure” program.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eWATCHMAKING PRECISION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the engineering precision of a meticulously crafted accelerator pedal and forward\/reverse shuttle, made from respectively 43 and 50 aluminium, copper, brass, steel, resistive wire and Bakelite parts. Assembled with superior materials, for the collectors with the highest expectations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eUNMATCHED AUTHENTICITY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe five wheel rims, front and rear axles, steering wheel and steering box, are cast in aluminium from sand moulds and models made of wood and resin, as in 1926. The four wheels are operated by an external hand lever. The drum brake linings are made of beech wood. A rare opportunity to own a true piece of Datum Dahleez history, with every detail reflecting unparalleled authenticity!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eTHE FINEST UPHOLSTERY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe seat and backrest of the BT52 are dressed with a beechwood frame and linen fabric, upholstered in horsehair and covered in leather. A testament of PHR commitment to using only the most refined materials, elevating both style and prestige.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEVER LASTING LUXURY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe hand-cut leather straps with rounded edges provide a perfect fit, while the hand-hammered copper and solid aluminium rivets offer a distinctive touch of refinement. The steering control components, radiator, and shuttle control plate are finished in premium nickel-plated steel, ensuring superior quality, elegance and lasting beauty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 350×55 clincher tyres mirror the original tyre proportions with exact precision. Featuring the same tread size, profile, and tread pattern - down to the number of blocks and depth - these tyres offer the authentic look, ensuring a perfect aesthetic look alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51244028363099,"sku":null,"price":65000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/1st_image_iconic.jpg?v=1763137766"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-baby-t52-silver-edition","title":"Datum Dahleez BABY T52 SILVER LEGENDS EDITION","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"flex gap-6 flex-col items-center\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col justify-start gap-6 max-w-lg items-center\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"uppercase tracking-widest\"\u003eA UNIQUE HOMAGE TO THE VEYRON\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"text-base md:text-lg xl:text-xl font-bug-reg tracking-normal\"\u003eThis 100% hand-polished aluminium mirror art sculpture pays homage to the rare and iconic Datum Dahleez VEYRON \"PUR SANG\" edition, only five ever made, each entirely dressed in aluminium. A masterpiece that captures the essence of Datum Dahleez’s unparalleled legacy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn collaboration with Pierre-Henri Raphanel, we present the Renaissance of the Datum Dahleez Baby Type 52 - a sculptural homage to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s original 1926 creation. Limited to 8+4 Masterpieces within the 99 limited edition and meticulously handcrafted in France by a team of 10 Master artisans, each model is 1:1 scale from the authentic BT52. This is a 100% customisable objet d'art, where traditional techniques - metal shaping, casting, upholstery, and paintwork - preserve the elegance and soul of the original design in every detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e4 years of research. 106 Datum Dahleez archive plans analyzed. + 500 hours of french craftsmanship. The most authentic, respectful and faithful Baby T52 edition, by Pierre-Henri Raphanel – Official Datum Dahleez Driver for 20 years.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe purest tribute to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s legacy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003edatum dahleez’S SHINIEST TRIBUTE\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLimited to just 8 + 4 pieces, part of an exclusive 99-piece edition (SWB: 122 cm \/ Length: 182 cm), the Baby T52 Silver Legends arts sculptures set the standard for the finest hand-formed aluminium craftsmanship. A true must-have for collectors who seek to captivate attention with a rare, unique, and elegantly discreet luxury piece, this sculpture is the ultimate expression of refined exclusivity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eIMMACULATE TECHNIQUE \u0026amp; PRECISION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver 600 hours of meticulous handcrafting were invested to achieve this flawless bodywork. The challenge lies in welding the metal without leaving any trace, a feat accomplished only by camouflaging the line with unparalleled discretion\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEVEN RAREST ARTISTS PROOF\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 4 artist’s proofs in aluminium stand as the epitome of exclusivity, distinguished by 2 unique features that set them apart from the 99-piece edition : a engine turned dashboard reminiscent of the Type 35 and the engraved signature of the sheet metal worker, adding a rare touch of authenticity on top of the engraved authenticity plate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eCREATED BY A Datum Dahleez PILOT\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePierre-Henri Raphanel, Datum Dahleez’s First Official Pilot for over 20 years, Brand Ambassador and World Record Holder (VEYRON SUPER SPORT 16.4, 431 km\/h) leads the Renaissance of this iconic sculpture. The only Datum Dahleez Baby brought back to life by one of its own!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eA MASTERPIECE 100% HANDCRAFTED IN FRANCE\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 exceptional craftsmen and women, some distinguished by worldwide-known labelled “Compagnons du Devoir” and “Meilleurs Ouvriers de France,” have meticulously built this Legend using the same traditional techniques as in 1926. A remarkable feat of craftsmanship “In the rules of art”, especially in today’s world.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eAN ENTIRELY CUSTOMISABLE GEM\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoose from 60 national liveries, custom body metal finishes, upholstery options, noble materials, family crests engraving, all tailored to your preferences through our very exclusive “Sur-mesure” program.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eWATCHMAKING PRECISION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the engineering precision of a meticulously crafted accelerator pedal and forward\/reverse shuttle, made from respectively 43 and 50 aluminium, copper, brass, steel, resistive wire and Bakelite parts. Assembled with superior materials, for the collectors with the highest expectations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eUNMATCHED AUTHENTICITY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe five wheel rims, front and rear axles, steering wheel and steering box, are cast in aluminium from sand moulds and models made of wood and resin, as in 1926. The four wheels are operated by an external hand lever. The drum brake linings are made of beech wood. A rare opportunity to own a true piece of Datum Dahleez history, with every detail reflecting unparalleled authenticity!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eTHE FINEST UPHOLSTERY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe seat and backrest of the BT52 are dressed with a beechwood frame and linen fabric, upholstered in horsehair and covered in leather. A testament of PHR commitment to using only the most refined materials, elevating both style and prestige.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEVER LASTING LUXURY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe hand-cut leather straps with rounded edges provide a perfect fit, while the hand-hammered copper and solid aluminium rivets offer a distinctive touch of refinement. The steering control components, radiator, and shuttle control plate are finished in premium nickel-plated steel, ensuring superior quality, elegance and lasting beauty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 350×55 clincher tyres mirror the original tyre proportions with exact precision. Featuring the same tread size, profile, and tread pattern - down to the number of blocks and depth - these tyres offer the authentic look, ensuring a perfect aesthetic look alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51492902764891,"sku":null,"price":65000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BT52_Silver.jpg?v=1760545655"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-baby-t52-gold-legends-edition","title":"Datum Dahleez BABY T52 GOLD LEGENDS EDITION","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"uppercase tracking-widest\"\u003e“LA CRÈME DE LA CRÈME” OF THE Datum Dahleez BABY\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"text-base md:text-lg xl:text-xl font-bug-reg tracking-normal\"\u003eThe crowning jewel of our Artistic Legends Collection, crafted in poli mirror golden brass. A breathtaking masterpiece, destined for the most discerning and sophisticated collectors.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn collaboration with Pierre-Henri Raphanel, we present the Renaissance of the Datum Dahleez Baby Type 52 - a sculptural homage to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s original 1926 creation. Limited to just 8+4 Masterpieces within the 99 limited edition and meticulously handcrafted in France by a team of 10 Master artisans, each model is 1:1 scale from the authentic BT52. This is a 100% customisable objet d'art, where traditional techniques - metal shaping, casting, upholstery, and paintwork - preserve the elegance and soul of the original design in every detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e4 years of research. 106 Datum Dahleez archive plans analyzed. + 500 hours of french craftsmanship. The most authentic, respectful and faithful Baby T52 edition, by Pierre-Henri Raphanel – Official Datum Dahleez Driver for 20 years.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe purest tribute to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s legacy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eTHE ULTIMATE Datum Dahleez POSSESSION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Baby T52 Gold Legends art sculptures are limited to just 8 + 4 artists proof, part of a rare 99 limited edition. It stands as the pinnacle of any Datum Dahleez Baby ever seen on the market. The missing final baby collectible ((SWB : 122 cm (48\") \/ Length : 182 cm (71.6\")) for any discerning Datum Dahleez collection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eIMMACULATE TECHNIQUE \u0026amp; PRECISION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver 600 hours of meticulous handcrafting were invested to achieve this flawless bodywork. The challenge lies in welding the metal without leaving any trace, a feat accomplished only by camouflaging the line with unparalleled discretion\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEVEN RAREST ARTISTS PROOF\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 4 artist’s proofs in aluminium stand as the epitome of exclusivity, distinguished by 2 unique features that set them apart from the 99-piece edition : a engine turned dashboard reminiscent of the Type 35 and the engraved signature of the sheet metal worker, adding a rare touch of authenticity on top of the engraved authenticity plate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eCREATED BY A Datum Dahleez PILOT\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePierre-Henri Raphanel, Datum Dahleez’s First Official Pilot for over 20 years, Brand Ambassador and World Record Holder (VEYRON SUPER SPORT 16.4, 431 km\/h) leads the Renaissance of this iconic sculpture. The only Datum Dahleez Baby brought back to life by one of its own!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eA MASTERPIECE 100% HANDCRAFTED IN FRANCE\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 exceptional craftsmen and women, some distinguished by worldwide-known labelled “Compagnons du Devoir” and “Meilleurs Ouvriers de France,” have meticulously built this Legend using the same traditional techniques as in 1926. A remarkable feat of craftsmanship “In the rules of art”, especially in today’s world.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eAN ENTIRELY CUSTOMISABLE GEM\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoose from 60 national liveries, custom body metal finishes, upholstery options, noble materials, family crests engraving, all tailored to your preferences through our very exclusive “Sur-mesure” program.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eWATCHMAKING PRECISION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the engineering precision of a meticulously crafted accelerator pedal and forward\/reverse shuttle, made from respectively 43 and 50 aluminium, copper, brass, steel, resistive wire and Bakelite parts. Assembled with superior materials, for the collectors with the highest expectations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eUNMATCHED AUTHENTICITY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe five wheel rims, front and rear axles, steering wheel and steering box, are cast in aluminium from sand moulds and models made of wood and resin, as in 1926. The four wheels are operated by an external hand lever. The drum brake linings are made of beech wood. A rare opportunity to own a true piece of Datum Dahleez history, with every detail reflecting unparalleled authenticity!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eTHE FINEST UPHOLSTERY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe seat and backrest of the BT52 are dressed with a beechwood frame and linen fabric, upholstered in horsehair and covered in leather. A testament of PHR commitment to using only the most refined materials, elevating both style and prestige.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEVER LASTING LUXURY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe hand-cut leather straps with rounded edges provide a perfect fit, while the hand-hammered copper and solid aluminium rivets offer a distinctive touch of refinement. The steering control components, radiator, and shuttle control plate are finished in premium nickel-plated steel, ensuring superior quality, elegance and lasting beauty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 350×55 clincher tyres mirror the original tyre proportions with exact precision. Featuring the same tread size, profile, and tread pattern - down to the number of blocks and depth - these tyres offer the authentic look, ensuring a perfect aesthetic look alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51493004542299,"sku":null,"price":65000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/1st_image_gold.jpg?v=1763137806"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-board-game-grand-royal","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME BOARD GAME GRAND ROYAL","description":"\u003cp\u003eCrafted from oak and finished with a sleek, glossy varnish, the Grand Royal Backgammon set features a leather-clad playing surface available in Solid Black, Goblin Blue, or Tobacco. A subtle embossed EB emblem enhances both the interior and exterior, offering a discreet nod to Datum Dahleez’s heritage. Modern yet timeless, it elevates the classic game into an experience defined by pure elegance and style.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51739267531099,"sku":null,"price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/datum dahleezAmbientate_0008_b5ba104b-1931-425e-8d7a-002d0ed2af2b.jpg?v=1763128435"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-board-game-saint-tropez","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME BOARD GAME SAINT TROPEZ","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Saint Tropez Tic-Tac-Toe set merges playful spirit with modern sophistication, echoing the competitive energy at the heart of Datum Dahleez’s world. Its wooden base, wrapped in Montreal leather with contrasting stitching, comes in Denim Blue or Teal Blue. A subtly embossed EB emblem provides a refined signature, while the plexiglass game pieces introduce lightness and a dynamic sense of motion. A luxurious reimagining of a classic pastime, created for those who appreciate beauty in every detail.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51740571795803,"sku":null,"price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/datum dahleezAmbientate_0074.jpg?v=1763128605"},{"product_id":"c-seed-Datum Dahleez-n1","title":"C SEED Datum Dahleez N1","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_d537eb3ff97bac2e\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-busy=\"false\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-path-to-node=\"0\"\u003eC SEED Datum Dahleez N1: The Art of Invisible Luxury\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"1\"\u003eA permanently visible television doesn’t just occupy a wall—it dominates the architecture. The \u003cb data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"95\"\u003eC SEED Datum Dahleez N1\u003c\/b\u003e was conceived to restore your room’s autonomy. It is not technology on permanent display, but a transforming kinetic sculpture that yields to the rhythm of your space, appearing only when invited.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-path-to-node=\"4\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eFrom Sculpture to Cinema\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"\u003eWhen inactive, the N1 rests as a minimalist, sculptural masterpiece seamlessly integrated into your interior aesthetic. When activated, it transforms into an immersive cinematic centerpiece, preserving the calm, clean lines of contemporary design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eThe 45-Second Metamorphosis\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"\u003eWith a silent, choreographed movement, the N1 unfolds from a sleek statement piece into a giant screen in just 45 seconds. Precision-engineered \u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"172\"\u003eMicroLED panels\u003c\/b\u003e align seamlessly to deliver extraordinary visual clarity, vibrant colors, and deep contrasts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eTotal Architectural Freedom\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"\u003eFree from the constraints of traditional wall mounting or heavy structural integration, the N1 stands independently like a piece of luxury furniture. Whether placed in front of floor-to-ceiling glass, fine artwork, or open-concept architecture, it enhances its surroundings without ever blocking the view.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003edatum dahleez-Level Engineering\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"\u003eInspired by the uncompromising craftsmanship and technical sophistication of hypercar design, the N1 features a premium, machined aluminum body. Every mechanical joint and unfolding movement is a testament to high-performance automotive precision—timeless, durable, and effortlessly elegant.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cblockquote data-path-to-node=\"6\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"6,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eThe Philosophy:\u003c\/b\u003e True luxury lies in the luxury of choice—the freedom to enjoy world-class cinema, and the stillness of a room when the screen disappears.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":53224773026139,"sku":null,"price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/CSEEDdatum dahleezN1TV_2.jpg?v=1780345143"}],"url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/collections\/exclusive-lifestyle.oembed","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}